	(text "Everything the dedicated ports did not claim.\n\nDerived from what the other sheets actually routed, not from a\nhand-kept list of spares - such a list goes stale the first time\na port moves, and the symptom is a pin connected to nothing.\n\nThe three headers carry DIFFERENT signals: each channel owns\ndifferent dedicated ports, so different signals are left over.\nSame part and same pin count; only the net names differ."
